    "id": "3374002",
    "original": "よいものを読んだ後、何も書くな、何も言うな、お前は、その美しい恍惚を、お前の汚れた言葉で汚す恥知らずを敢てするな。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "13614688",
        "text": "After reading something beautiful, write nothing, say nothing; do not be so shameless as to sully that exquisite rapture with your filthy words."
